Package: apx
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         podman | docker.io,
         uidmap
Recommends: apx-stacks
Description: create and manage container-based Linux subsystems
 Apx lets you create subsystems based on other Linux distributions
 (Fedora, Arch, Ubuntu, ...) and install their packages without touching
 the host. Subsystems are podman containers managed through a bundled
 copy of distrobox.
 .
 Apx ships no stacks of its own; install apx-stacks for a default set.
